    <h1 style= "color: red; text-align: center;">Ms Dhoni</h1>
    <ul style="color: red; border: 2px solid red;">
  <li>MS Dhoni is one of the greatest cricketers in the world.</li>
  <li>His full name is Mahendra Singh Dhoni.</li>
  <li>He was born on 7 July 1981 in Ranchi, Jharkhand.</li>
  <li>Dhoni was the captain of the Indian cricket team.</li>
  <li>He is famous for his calm and smart captaincy.</li>
  <li>India won the 2007 T20 World Cup under his captaincy.</li>
  <li>India won the 2011 Cricket World Cup under his leadership.</li>
  <li>He is known as one of the best wicketkeepers in cricket history.</li>
  <li>His nickname is "Captain Cool".</li>
  <li>MS Dhoni is an inspiration for millions of cricket fans.</li>
    </ul>
